(6556117, 976528, 23439, '<td valign="top">This has to ribbon, wonderful job. Love the no elephant balloons sign. Only thing I can think to improve, is the top border looks off to me, being smaller than the sides. But that''s a very minor gripe on an excellent job taking advantage of the expert ruleset.</td>', 'This has to ribbon, wonderful job. Love the no elephant balloons sign. Only thing I can think to improve, is the top border looks off to me, being smaller than the sides. But that''s a very minor gripe on an excellent job taking advantage of the expert ruleset.', '2011-09-30 17:26:58.000000', NULL, 1),
