(6557315, 976423, 28427, '<td valign="top">I like the balance between the intense blue of the sky and the fresh green of the grass.  With in that fresh green the lonely tree that persisted in growing.  The quote... I''ll adopt and keep in mind.</td>', 'I like the balance between the intense blue of the sky and the fresh green of the grass.  With in that fresh green the lonely tree that persisted in growing.  The quote... I''ll adopt and keep in mind.', '2011-10-01 17:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557316, 976311, 28427, '<td valign="top">So clean, so simple.  A reflection and a mirroring: great work.</td>', 'So clean, so simple.  A reflection and a mirroring: great work.', '2011-10-01 17:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557317, 976322, 28427, '<td valign="top">LOL - a great replacement for the original quote :)</td>', 'LOL - a great replacement for the original quote :)', '2011-10-01 17:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557318, 976576, 28427, '<td valign="top">A quote I use often myself, but now I wouldn''t mind rusting a bit.<br/>The pile of rusty stuff is great.  I love the colors of the rust.</td>', 'A quote I use often myself, but now I wouldn''t mind rusting a bit.The pile of rusty stuff is great.  I love the colors of the rust.', '2011-10-01 17:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557344, 975325, 28427, '<td valign="top">Nice quote - Very nice photograph.  Beautiful DOF and I like the movement of the paw while the rest of the cub looks really frozen.  What was he going for?</td>', 'Nice quote - Very nice photograph.  Beautiful DOF and I like the movement of the paw while the rest of the cub looks really frozen.  What was he going for?', '2011-10-01 18:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557346, 976533, 28427, '<td valign="top">Brute intimidation by an old lion... Perfect subject to illustrate this quote.  Great details in the fur.</td>', 'Brute intimidation by an old lion... Perfect subject to illustrate this quote.  Great details in the fur.', '2011-10-01 18:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557347, 976477, 28427, '<td valign="top">The contradiction is funny: mobile vs never leave your own little world.<br/>I simply <i>love</i> the b&amp;w tones and the symmetry.</td>', 'The contradiction is funny: mobile vs never leave your own little world.I simply love the b&w tones and the symmetry.', '2011-10-01 18:24:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557349, 976339, 28427, '<td valign="top">I think that''s what my problem is actually. <br/>Perfect way to illustrate the quote. And the photograph: as perfect as can be.</td>', 'I think that''s what my problem is actually. Perfect way to illustrate the quote. And the photograph: as perfect as can be.', '2011-10-01 18:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6557350, 976392, 28427, '<td valign="top">I should hang this up at my workplace.  Maybe this would wake up the management and make them understand we are only human beings.  At first I thought the pencil was slightly out of focus, but I think it''s just because of the fact it''s an old bitten one.</td>', 'I should hang this up at my workplace.  Maybe this would wake up the management and make them understand we are only human beings.  At first I thought the pencil was slightly out of focus, but I think it''s just because of the fact it''s an old bitten one.', '2011-10-01 18:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
