(6557358, 975833, 28427, '<td valign="top">Shame you didn''t create an actual poster.  For once text was allowed and you''ve restricted yourself to advanced editing.  I hope this will not cost you too much points.</td>', 'Shame you didn''t create an actual poster.  For once text was allowed and you''ve restricted yourself to advanced editing.  I hope this will not cost you too much points.', '2011-10-01 18:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
