(6563233, 976537, 67343, '<td valign="top">My sister Sharon and I went to zoo with this challenge in mind hoping to get a picture it was taken at the Little Rock Zoo.  They only have two giraffe there. I was just at the right place at the right time. I had other images I thought about using but decided this one. Thanks for all the wonderful comments.<br/></td>', 'My sister Sharon and I went to zoo with this challenge in mind hoping to get a picture it was taken at the Little Rock Zoo.  They only have two giraffe there. I was just at the right place at the right time. I had other images I thought about using but decided this one. Thanks for all the wonderful comments.', '2011-10-07 10:49:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6563235, 976534, 131871, '<td valign="top">Thanks All!  There should be no DQ for me this time!! :) I read and re-read the rules to make sure I understand what I am allowed to do. <br/> <br/>Thanks for the support!<br/> <br/>This image was inspired by this poster found online:<br/> <br/>//1.bp.blogspot.com/_akLHpeO7qyA/TCD29LIGmuI/AAAAAAAABcI/cW6Sy21odg8/s1600/gravity.jpg<br/> <br/>When I saw the picture in the link, the final image above popped into my head! It always helps me to have an idea of what I want to create before I turn on my camera. :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-10-07 10:12:50.</i></td>', 'Thanks All!  There should be no DQ for me this time!! :) I read and re-read the rules to make sure I understand what I am allowed to do.  Thanks for the support! This image was inspired by this poster found online: //1.bp.blogspot.com/_akLHpeO7qyA/TCD29LIGmuI/AAAAAAAABcI/cW6Sy21odg8/s1600/gravity.jpg When I saw the picture in the link, the final image above popped into my head! It always helps me to have an idea of what I want to create before I turn on my camera. :)', '2011-10-07 10:49:45.000000', '2011-10-07 11:12:50.000000', 0),
