(6565388, 975114, 132251, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alexkc:</b></div><hr/><i> I don''t think voters lack sense of humor, otherwise you wouldn''t get 58 votes over 7 for a not very good photoshop work. But I have to say that it''s very funny indeed  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>"lack of sense of humor" was an "anticipated" critique. I see now that is was pretty well accepted (although there was almost the same amount of votes 5 or under)<br/> <br/>I am proud of my "not very good photoshop work" as you put it!! It was my first shot at Expert Editing, and I learned a lot.</td>', 'Originally posted by Alexkc: I don''t think voters lack sense of humor, otherwise you wouldn''t get 58 votes over 7 for a not very good photoshop work. But I have to say that it''s very funny indeed  :)   "lack of sense of humor" was an "anticipated" critique. I see now that is was pretty well accepted (although there was almost the same amount of votes 5 or under) I am proud of my "not very good photoshop work" as you put it!! It was my first shot at Expert Editing, and I learned a lot.', '2011-10-10 10:46:11.000000', NULL, 0),
