(6565434, 976478, 124190, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by HawkinsT:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LoVi:</b></div><hr/><i> ....I thought it was       watching us................? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>That depends who you listen to =). My initial thinking with this challenge was to do something along the lines of soviet propaganda. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>....no worries...everything I say makes no sense.......or is it nothing I say makes sense.....I''m confused...   ;-)<br/> <br/>......I have some SERIOUS SOVIET stories if you ever want me to tell you....  I like your work.....alot.</td>', 'Originally posted by HawkinsT: Originally posted by LoVi: ....I thought it was       watching us................?   That depends who you listen to =). My initial thinking with this challenge was to do something along the lines of soviet propaganda.   ....no worries...everything I say makes no sense.......or is it nothing I say makes sense.....I''m confused...   ;-) ......I have some SERIOUS SOVIET stories if you ever want me to tell you....  I like your work.....alot.', '2011-10-10 11:41:07.000000', NULL, 0),
