(6565719, 976478, 131284, '<td valign="top">Thanks Vivian. I''d enjoy hearing any of your stories! I was too young to remember the collapse of the Soviet Union, although an ex of mine was Ukrainian and grew up during those times, she had some pretty harrowing (as well as many good) accounts from when she was a child. It was interesting to hear someone''s experiences first hand like that.</td>', 'Thanks Vivian. I''d enjoy hearing any of your stories! I was too young to remember the collapse of the Soviet Union, although an ex of mine was Ukrainian and grew up during those times, she had some pretty harrowing (as well as many good) accounts from when she was a child. It was interesting to hear someone''s experiences first hand like that.', '2011-10-10 18:31:37.000000', NULL, 0),
