(6578886, 976574, 18505, '<td valign="top">I will attest that this was not over-saturated.  This IS autumn in Colorado - with brilliant yellows, reds and golds so vibrant it seems other-worldly.  What you cannot experience but is suggested with this image, is the remarkable experience of watching the aspens "quake" with the breeze - the infinitely changing colorscape, the sounds, and the forest fragrances of pines, junipers, and aspens with a hint of snow.  It is an amazing experience to walk in these woods, look up to these mountains and immerse oneself in this glorious corner of our planet.<br/> <br/>Thank you, Richard, for this beautiful reminder...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-10-29 13:00:25.</i></td>', 'I will attest that this was not over-saturated.  This IS autumn in Colorado - with brilliant yellows, reds and golds so vibrant it seems other-worldly.  What you cannot experience but is suggested with this image, is the remarkable experience of watching the aspens "quake" with the breeze - the infinitely changing colorscape, the sounds, and the forest fragrances of pines, junipers, and aspens with a hint of snow.  It is an amazing experience to walk in these woods, look up to these mountains and immerse oneself in this glorious corner of our planet. Thank you, Richard, for this beautiful reminder...', '2011-10-29 12:16:21.000000', '2011-10-29 14:00:25.000000', 0),
(6600454, 976488, 20608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ragga2000:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by MAK:</b></div><hr/><i> Are there lots of half naked folk running around your freezing country (laurus etc) Can''t wait to visit next year but I may have to wear a coat... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes absolutely  - you don´t need to bring any cloths at all  ;o)<br/> <br/>Are you planning to come for sure? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes definitely, The wife &amp; I are dreaming about coming to Iceland it is TOP of our visit list, the only thing holding us back is the demon cash itself... It will happen though.</td>', 'Originally posted by Ragga2000: Originally posted by MAK: Are there lots of half naked folk running around your freezing country (laurus etc) Can''t wait to visit next year but I may have to wear a coat...   Yes absolutely  - you don´t need to bring any cloths at all  ;o) Are you planning to come for sure?   Yes definitely, The wife & I are dreaming about coming to Iceland it is TOP of our visit list, the only thing holding us back is the demon cash itself... It will happen though.', '2011-11-21 19:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
